1
00:00:00,450 --> 00:00:05,936
Open Cedar Notes and click Export notes in the top right.

2
00:00:06,950 --> 00:00:11,407
In the Format menu, select Markdown.

3
00:00:12,450 --> 00:00:17,643
Turn on Include attachments, then click Download.

4
00:00:18,700 --> 00:00:24,378
Open the downloaded ZIP file to see the notes and attachments.
